  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: near Milici</p>\r\n<p>Remains of fifth century B.C. ashlar fortification walls on the a local peak (Monte Ciappa) near Rodi Milici may be connected with the site of Longane (<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/2533/pleiades/items/itemKey/WBM4X5NH/q/poleis\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Hansen and Nielsen 2004, 212</a>).</p>",
